/*
    Both players start in a start room, they need to get to an exit room.
    There is a start room with an upper shelf, connected to the exit room.
    The door to the exit room is locked and the key is on the upper shelf. The upper shelf cannot be reached from the ground.
    There is a box and a magic wand in the box that lets a player cast a hover spell.
    The hover spell can only be cast on someone else, you cannot cast it on yourself.
*/
